                "none": [
                    "Dive into this spicy roommates-to-lovers romance about a girl running from her past� and the irresistible heartbreaker who may just ruin her plans.\n\nTHEO\n\nI've spent years chasing thrills and breaking hearts.\n\nLove was always someone else's weakness... until Thalia stormed into my life.\n\nBeautiful. Guarded. Haunted by demons she won�t let me see.\n\nShe makes me feel things I�ve never felt. Protectiveness, obsession, and a desperate need to be the man she can trust. The man she deserves.\n\nBut just when I�m ready to give her everything, Thalia�s past crashes into our present.\n\nNow, being her hero means confronting a villain I never saw coming�\n\nAnd praying the love we�ve found is strong enough to survive the aftermath.\n\n\nTHALIA\n\nThree suitcases, no plan, and a desperate need to escape my sins. That�s all I have left.\n\nAnd the last thing I need is Theo Hayes�Newport�s notorious playboy.\n\nBut when he offers me a place to stay. I can�t afford to say no.\n\nWith every lingering glance, every gentle touch, my walls begin to crack, and I start to believe I could have more than a sketchy past and uncertain future.\n\nTheo deserves to know the truth, the secrets I�ve buried deep, but if I let him in, it might not just destroy me...\n\nIt could take him down with me.\n\n\nTropes:\n\nRoommates to lovers\nGolden Retriever MMC\nHurt/Comfort\nSpicy!\nSlow-burn\nInsta lust\nPining\nMulti-cultural\n\nFAQ:\nHEA!\nNo OW Drama\nNo cheating\n\nIf you love an addictive roommates-to-lovers romance, sizzling chemistry, and a confident, protective hero who will stop at nothing to win over the feisty woman of his dreams, dive into this standalone novel in the Hayes Brothers series. No cliffhanger�just the perfect blend of slow-burn and insta-lust."
